  "description": "Nalix.Logging is a high-performance, asynchronous logging subsystem designed\nfor large-scale and low-latency applications in the Nalix ecosystem.\n\nIt features a modular engine with pluggable sinks (console, file, email, channel),\nbatched file writing, and fully configurable logging options.\nBuilt with a zero-lock, channel-based pipeline, it ensures efficient,\nnon-blocking log processing under heavy concurrent workloads.",
